Pull the camera back over 2 seconds, keep it there for 5, then give it back to the game:

```csharp
var camera = player.Camera;
camera.LerpDistance(150f, 400f, 2f);
camera.Maintain(CameraSetting.Distance, 5f, delay: 2f);
```

